  "title": {
    "rendered": "Partitions in trucks"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://stathis.com.gr/en/truck-refrigerators/\">Back</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>For the combined transportation of products, under different temperatures, <strong>is constructed</strong></strong> <strong>a fixed or movable partition.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Pommier – Furgocar </strong>automatic separator systems divide the interior space into two rooms of different temperatures with a partition moving along the entire length of the chamber, but also with the&nbsp;possibility of suspension on the roof.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our refrigerated bodies’ partitions are considered to be the most modern systems&nbsp;with the following characteristics:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Special mechanisms inside the rails (10 bearings in each rail), that make the displacement&nbsp;of the partition easier than any other similar system. Pommier &#8211; Furgocar has tried and tested ball bearing mechanisms operate smoothly even after 10 years of continuous use.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Shock absorbers (2 to 4 depending on the dimensions of the separator), with a force of 2500 N, additionally facilitate the lifting of the partition, so that a single person can effortlessly move it along the chamber, varying the two rooms of different temperatures. </li>\n\n\n\n<li>There is also the possibility to anchor the partition on the roof, leaving the whole space for products which need one temperature.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The separator system consists of:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Panels with the required reinforcements</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Special sealing rubbers</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Aluminum rails on the roof and mechanisms for rolling the partition along the length of the chamber </li>\n\n\n\n<li>With shock absorbers and stop mechanisms for anchoring the partition on the roof</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rubber fixing mechanism to anchor the partition to the floor, for large compartments</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Locking devices for anchoring the partition to the side panels of the chamber, for small and medium-sized chambers</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Side rails for fixing the partition (if needed)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Mechanism for unlocking the partition by means of a cable clamp</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-id=\"1415\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Adelift-ανεμιστήρας-2-1024x768-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1415 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Adelift-ανεμιστήρας-2-1024x768-1.jpg 1024w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Adelift-ανεμιστήρας-2-1024x768-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Adelift-ανεμιστήρας-2-1024x768-1-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024/768;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1419\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/DSC02221-768x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1419 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/DSC02221-768x1024-1.jpg 768w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/DSC02221-768x1024-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/1024;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"767\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1417\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_090-767x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1417 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_090-767x1024-1.jpg 767w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_090-767x1024-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 767px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 767px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 767/1024;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1418\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_02214.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1418 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_02214.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_02214-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_02214-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1416\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_02805-768x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1416 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_02805-768x1024-1.jpg 768w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-diax_02805-768x1024-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/1024;\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n",
